    "architecturalHeights": "Retained Wikidata height36m has no qualifying dimension or reference URL. Native PMTiles has no qualified height. Visualization uses base/gallery floor10.6..11.2m, columned gallery to17.7m, smaller turret caps23..24.8m/finials25.4m, upper shaft30m/head30.4m, steep roof35.4m and main finial36m. Floor, aperture/corbel/pier/rail/roof condition and hidden reverse inventory are picture-led estimates; no measured floor count or conservation survey is claimed."
